# Project Overview

LangOctopus MCP is a retro-style chat interface for interacting with a LangGraph MCP agent.

## Core Components

- **Backend**: Flask server with Socket.IO integration that connects to the LangGraph MCP agent
  - Main entrypoint: [backend/app.py](mdc:backend/app.py)
  
- **Frontend**: React application with a retro-style UI featuring robot avatars and chat interface
  - Main component: [frontend/src/components/App.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/App.jsx)
  - Chat components: 
    - [frontend/src/components/ChatHistory.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/ChatHistory.jsx)
    - [frontend/src/components/LeftRobot.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/LeftRobot.jsx)
    - [frontend/src/components/RightRobot.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/RightRobot.jsx)

- **Agent**: LangGraph MCP agent that can answer math and weather questions
  - Agent client: [src/agent/client.py](mdc:src/agent/client.py)
  - MCP Servers:
    - [src/mcp_servers/math_server.py](mdc:src/mcp_servers/math_server.py)
    - [src/mcp_servers/weather_server.py](mdc:src/mcp_servers/weather_server.py)

## Running the Application

- [run_ui.sh](mdc:run_ui.sh) - Script to run the frontend and backend servers
- [run.py](mdc:run.py) - Main runner script

## Testing

- [run_tests.py](mdc:run_tests.py) - Test runner script
- [test_queries.py](mdc:test_queries.py) - Sample test queries
